{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >London: Echoes of The Past is a short yuri mystery visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious woman returns back from the dead, and the dusty past surfaces. Between a gloomy school girl and a glamorous ex-girlfriend,  every clue interwines. Who is the mastermind behind the scene? Play as a detective heroine in 1935 London, embark on a journey of love and growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/952d97ed7f3187e5a75d0a6989034b66.avif?t=1765810723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/952d97ed7f3187e5a75d0a6989034b66.avif?t=1765810723 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm, intelligent private detective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agent with a secret mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Could it be that every reunions is just another deadly gamble elaborated by the fate?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/f2cf2a6dbb74e78669f410d1b1640271.avif?t=1765810723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/f2cf2a6dbb74e78669f410d1b1640271.avif?t=1765810723 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stubborn, lively young girl with a strange obsession with He Yaqiong</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A student client who awaked the dusty memory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIt's hard to say, things are unpredictable, some things always change. Don't you think so?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/291411c19652a17b1ebe8285a07882dc.avif?t=1765810723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras_big/291411c19652a17b1ebe8285a07882dc.avif?t=1765810723 width=800 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle, elegant, glamorous and mysterious ex-girlfriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unidentified international businesswoman</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI've often wondered what kind of person you would become, Ya. Thank you for giving me the answer.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre Commissions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost and Found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tangible riddles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A foreign land, an old friend, a strange case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the connection among them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a time for justice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the bullet takes flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you pierce through the fog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the truth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuri Mystery Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90,000 Words</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cel Shading Backgrounds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ CGs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides, our game includes a short extra story on time travel of about 20,000 words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The extra story is set in Iceland 1980, where the characters travel to the future and bump into another side of destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this part of the story, you will unlock the elderly images of the characters as time goes by, and witness an extended version of their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725910/extras/0a627ff5c34380951a1bd690ec4a52a1.avif?t=1765810723\" width=1200 height=594 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Wittiest Detective in London","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/d8f724f44002e6e1ab0577052f3a5ec23be0b88a.jpg"},{"name":"Little Sister\u2019s Obsession","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/7a8bf0d2e0490d4e1aff9b41c753fb7123110651.jpg"},{"name":"The Familiarity I Resist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/d1ef26172d5aaf6d217eb2a705278f7a5eb019ee.jpg"},{"name":"Confirming the Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/dc6f067758dcdf8d30c5c7969782827a28f67750.jpg"},{"name":"Love Yet to Bloom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/e35b01b7b0746a6118afa2cde85f9d3246e3a730.jpg"},{"name":"Trust Without Words","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/9b4eb5996d5310cbd85c12799c7261096634a24c.jpg"},{"name":"Secrets of the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/b263f6124a284e2b0e73145259e2a2a02a0258e8.jpg"},{"name":"Mysterious Visitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/b781709549cb06576cf31293fdc39e71d19d1b61.jpg"},{"name":"The Day Fate Changed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3725910/ea2a8d0e0fb87b1f1d3390ce16c4c81e276296ca.jpg"},{"name":"Regained Love","path":"h